# When Angels Fall (battlefield.when_angels_fall, The Garden of Ru'Hmet): helpers. Main (8-3 Status 4) registers
# area 1 and invites bob (8-3 at Status 5), cat (Dawn current: 8-3 completed) and dan (A Fate Decided current). bob
# and cat get the menu and enter; dan gets a lone release (no menu). Won with bfwin: 32001 to the three (bob and cat
# with the skip flag 1); each finish: the battlefield's move; 8-3's own 32001 finish moves only main's Status (4
# to 5).
lists TheGardenOfRuhmet/_0z0/onTrigger TheGardenOfRuhmet/onEventUpdate/32000 TheGardenOfRuhmet/onEventFinish/32000 TheGardenOfRuhmet/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=TheGardenOfRuhmet pos=420,-2,404 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char bob zone=TheGardenOfRuhmet pos=420,-2,404 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char cat zone=TheGardenOfRuhmet pos=420,-2,404 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char dan zone=TheGardenOfRuhmet pos=420,-2,404 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop WhenAngelsFall current
charvar Mission[6][828]Status 4
bob: mission Cop WhenAngelsFall current
bob: charvar Mission[6][828]Status 5
cat: mission Cop Dawn current
dan: mission Cop AFateDecided current
login
bob: login
invite bob
bob: accept
cat: login
invite cat
cat: accept
dan: login
invite dan
dan: accept
trigger _0z0
update 32000 option=1
finish
bob: trigger _0z0
bob: update 32000 option=1
bob: finish
cat: trigger _0z0
cat: update 32000 option=1
cat: finish
dan: trigger _0z0
dan: update 32000 option=1
dan: finish-if-event
tick 2000
bfwin
finish
bob: finish
cat: finish
dan: finish-if-event
tick 11000
